  "summary": "Duplicate Advisory: SvelteKit before 3.0.0 Open Redirect via Enhanced Form Actions",
  "details": "## Duplicate Advisory\n\nThis advisory has been withdrawn because it is a duplicate of GHSA-pfhg-q3qv-9q6r. This link is maintained to preserve external references.\n\n## Original Description\nSvelteKit (@sveltejs/kit) before 3.0.0 contains an open redirect vulnerability in enhanced form actions (use:enhance) on routes accepting paths beginning with a double slash. Attackers can craft action paths starting with // that become protocol-relative URLs, causing non-redirect form results to navigate victims to attacker-controlled sites.",
